those of us who are older.

487
00:33:45,850 --> 00:33:49,310
But of course, adults are also

488
00:33:49,310 --> 00:33:52,670
susceptible to these
infections on their

489
00:33:52,670 --> 00:33:54,750
own, even without
being around kids.

490
00:33:54,750 --> 00:33:58,970
So thank you very much.
And that concludes our

491
00:33:59,690 --> 00:34:03,530
lectures on the drugs
for the treatment of

492
00:34:03,530 --> 00:34:11,270
respiratory virus infection,
influenza, and COVID-19.